        "created_at": "2017-11-19T20:53:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am with Rabit, Sentinerds all the way.</p>\n<p>I do like X-Metal name for the fans of the team. I wonder is that is the in Comic book creator  universe name for them. But then again I don’t hear people who like X-Men or avengers have a fan name.</p>\n<p>I use SpeedyOlrac for all my online stuff.  Make it easier to know who I am.</p>\n<p>Side Note: X metal, after this con I meet a few of them and I can say they are just Humans who are also fans. I hear that Christopher is happy to see people dressing up as SC characters but seeing his reaction was refeshing.</p>",
